#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/efficientip.rst:43
msgid "**NAME:** Friendly name for this EfficientIP SOLIDserver integration"
msgstr "**NAME:** Friendly nombre para este EfficientIP SOLIDserver integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/efficientip.rst:44
